SQL was used to conduct structured data-quality checks on the NorthStar Logistics dataset.

The validation identified no duplicate order IDs, missing values in the selected fields, negative shipping costs, out-of-range customer ratings or delivery dates occurring before order dates.

This stage demonstrates the use of SQL for practical data preparation, validation and analytical quality assurance.

The completed checks provide a documented foundation for the next phase of the NorthStar Logistics performance analysis.